*.db-wal

# Scry recognition corpus: pixels are a LOCAL-ONLY asset store (200MB+ and
# growing every capture round). Ground truth (manifests, README) stays in git;
# images/scenes live only on the dev machine and catalog.json.gz is rebuilt by
# Tools/scry_build_corpus_catalog.py. See ScryCorpus/README.md.
GrimoraKit/Tests/GrimoraCoreTests/ScryCorpus/images/
GrimoraKit/Tests/GrimoraCoreTests/ScryCorpus/scenes/
GrimoraKit/Tests/GrimoraCoreTests/ScryCorpus/catalog.json.gz
